    "body": "**USER_SAFARI_PASS (owner acceptance, 2026-10-16):** The owner explicitly confirmed “все пасс” after testing the deployed mobile interface on their physical iPhone Safari. This closes all remaining Issue #434 acceptance points: Events → Battles horizontal swipe, compact/appropriate empty Events appearance without losing eligible First Event, and no unintended focus auto-zoom on mobile inputs. Earlier accepted profile-aware Battles/Споры label, no duplicate headers, DM ↔ Battles swipes and vertical scrolling remain accepted. Final fix merged as PR #436 into `main@c6880541934db9d92ff89141d7fa224b391e7515`; post-merge GitHub Pages deployment and CI succeeded. **Status: MERGED / DEPLOYED / CI PASS / USER_SAFARI_PASS.** Closing as completed, based on the owner's explicit physical Safari acceptance (not a Codex or browser-simulation claim).",
